  "about": {
    "description": "SPWO.d is a Dinari dShare that provides on-chain exposure to the referenced equity (SP Funds S&P World). dShares may only be issued and redeemed from wallets that have completed KYC, and Dinari states it screens wallets holding dShares as part of its AML program. The token includes a transfer blacklist feature for OFAC, AML, and account-security controls. Dinari states dividends and distributions are allocated using an on-chain snapshot and made available to withdraw from a USDC claim contract, and Dinari holds back shareholder voting rights from tokenholders.",
